    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>\u201cRestricted Footage\u201d is a horror and survival game for up to 4 players. You are entering into an area, where reportedly paranormal stuff is happening. Your purpose here is to take a footage with your action cam and to solve the paranormal case.<br><br>Action footage founded<br>-When you play the game, you actually experience the footage, which has been previously taken. So, due to the camera view, you will be experiencing an unique horror action.<br><br>Different paranormal footages<br>-There is a lot of creppypasta stories going on. So you have the chance to experience solving different paranormal cases through the action camera view.<br><br>Realistic approach<br>-We developed this indie game by using the Unreal Engine, which makes possible the development of a photorealistic environment and also the camera makes it even more realistic. <br> <br>Team Work<br>-If you play alone, solving the case will be much more difficult, because you need to accomplish lot of duties alone and interact with multiple items, while you are trying to handle the paranormal danger of the place. Multiplayer experience is highly recommended.",
